{"version":1,"key":"article:69","content":{"id":69,"title":"深拷贝的实现","author":"","content":[{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"014081b4-1b14-4ffd-aa41-6f76cc0928b3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"什么是拷贝？对一个变量进行拷贝是指将其表示的数据复制到另一个变量中，大部分情况下的目的是为了避免直接修改原始数据，以便后续进行多种不同的处理或对比。"}]},{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0b64244e-0423-405f-81a0-7f150dda5e2a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最简单的拷贝行为，直接将一个变量赋值给另一个变量"}]},{"language":"JavaScript","type":"code-block","uuid":"8f913376-0589-4d7d-a0d2-463dfa6ab843","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"fce347ed-cead-4575-a865-dc3a9eee2f70","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"let a = 1;\nlet b = a;\nb = 2;\nconsole.log(a, b); // 1, 2","collabId":"01a117bc-ec21-47e1-b0b7-ed50a602e32b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"language":"JavaScript","type":"code-block","uuid":"770f270e-2864-4cd6-a880-a1a8135d1280","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"f9d33729-8b11-46c6-92ad-fe4a671cc654","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const originalObj = {\n    a: 1\n}\nconst copyObj = originalObj;\ncopyObj.a = 2;\nconsole.log(originalObj.a, copyObj.a); // 2, 2","collabId":"c449dfac-26f8-4e69-b1d6-d4bdb72ab3dc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2f791200-0c10-4745-89c2-e634e7d92896","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以看到，这种直接赋值的方式对于基本数据类型和对象是不一样的，对于基本数据类型（"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"number"},{"type":"formatted","text":", "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"string"},{"type":"formatted","text":", "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"null"},{"type":"formatted","text":", "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"undefined"},{"type":"formatted","text":", "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"boolean"},{"type":"formatted","text":", "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"symbol"},{"type":"formatted","text":", "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"BigInt"},{"type":"formatted","text":"）直接赋值是完全隔离的，对拷贝的修改不会影响原数据，而对于对象（包括数组、日期、函数等特殊对象）直接进行赋值拷贝，"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"color":"#e33a32","darkColor":"#fa7873","text":"拷贝的仅仅是引用"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，因此对通过拷贝所持有的引用对数据进行的修改也会影响原来的对象。"}]},{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"bf181a74-6cea-414d-850b-9c43bce82f20","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因此对于对象的拷贝不能通过直接赋值来达到目的，而是需要将引用的数据进行拷贝，根据拷贝方式的不同，分为浅拷贝和深拷贝。"}]},{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3a8e28b7-3f18-4a14-834c-4994cebebd97","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"浅拷贝即只复制对象的一层属性，常见的方式有"}]},{"language":"JavaScript","type":"code-block","uuid":"8f044d89-7bf5-470d-8ff0-88ca4fac1b25","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"e27ba423-7c4f-4c48-bc64-99ca07ee7734","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const originalObj = {\n    a: 1\n}\nconst copyObj = {};\nfor (let key in obj1) {\n    obj2[key] = obj1[key];\n}","collabId":"9578ef4d-08c0-425c-a387-8269a92ea08a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"language":"JavaScript","type":"code-block","uuid":"00fdb771-defb-4694-afd9-c9f216703eb3","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"2b24cc6e-4fe7-4b3b-8893-997b930fd19c","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const originalObj = {\n    a: 1\n}\nconst copyObj = { \n    ...obj1\n}","collabId":"948f5466-b34a-45fb-84f6-3f772f484b5e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"language":"JavaScript","type":"code-block","uuid":"f148df4b-57e1-48bd-a462-a525dd092a23","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"40f812a8-5940-4626-9efc-1a62578a364e","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const originalObj = {\n    a: 1\n}\nconst copyObj = Object.assign({}, originalObj);","collabId":"dffdfeb8-eef0-4eeb-94f7-0479e50342d0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f100e690-34cd-47d6-bca5-058336ff1794","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果对象的属性的值也是一个对象，那么就会存在问题，复制的仍然是一个引用，对该引用的修改同样会影响原对象"}]},{"language":"JavaScript","type":"code-block","uuid":"f5033822-9a7d-461d-83a6-fa56705609db","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"05c88e44-5bad-4b2d-b1e7-d65c99bca144","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const originalObj = {\n    a: {\n        b: 1\n    }\n}\nconst copyObj = Object.assign({}, originalObj);\ncopyObj.a.b = 2;\nconsole.log(originalObj.a.b, copyObj.a.b); // 2 2","collabId":"ab7b61d3-918b-492e-bedb-7a8ef29d547a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"64267b0f-bfd4-47e7-8763-2d6377a7b1a1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果希望对拷贝的值的修改完全不影响原对象，这种情况下就需要进行深拷贝了。"}]},{"color":"red","type":"highlight-block","tauContract":"8d7373dfc1d83f7abd6f07067a85198c9127dba4aebf48d6d59b33956048da37","collabId":"2579adab-394d-42f5-8314-63b04bcd9789","children":[{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a921e37d-c668-49b9-b69a-2e7753c123ca","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"大部分情况下不需要使用深拷贝，原因："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"2a83dd3a-c536-450c-8387-b447ec2b6b13","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"998ec191-4b69-4f20-95f0-32e41dbdbe16","children":[{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7e99fc27-6e6d-424f-8c5a-4faf5add3176","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"浅拷贝够用了"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"c711c804-8c31-4147-83f9-f13a91aed001","children":[{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c350f199-321f-4844-9b4a-b52d3d64a478","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"深拷贝性能较低"}]}]}]}]},{"level":2,"type":"header","tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"cc183ac9-b3b2-4ea3-bed9-7dca9fa55781","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"JSON.parse、JSON.stringify"}]},{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7931eeab-e412-4c06-8b77-620e1cec0c25","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一种序列化的方式是将对象先序列为字符串，然后根据字符串重新反序列化为对象，该种方式创建的对象是完全开辟一块新的内存空间，和原来的对象没有任何关系："}]},{"language":"JavaScript","type":"code-block","uuid":"7f0facbc-cd32-4544-8e03-3de0924dba35","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"eebe139b-3945-41f4-aab5-8e6f42f3e85f","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const originalObj = {\n    a: {\n        b: 1\n    }\n}\nconst copyObj = JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(originalObj));\ncopyObj.a.b = 2;\n\nconsole.log(originalObj.a.b, copyObj.a.b); // 1 2","collabId":"bc483a5e-201b-4dac-9e48-f43cc9149c49","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"edc1e584-affb-4fa1-870f-cde3e1ac2857","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是该种方式有很多缺点："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"1c1b4b4c-fac1-4e16-a2ad-bc5c177c806b","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"cb0c7e7d-6013-46b8-a4da-6e91c2e3d4de","children":[{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ee907232-218a-4fff-803b-b865df30d08c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"只能处理被序列化的对象，对于特殊类型的对象在反序列化时会丢失特定的类型信息"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"c417e30a-106c-46ac-b027-b468ea74ae1d","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"80f303d0-9f82-420f-83ed-12667bb76df6","children":[{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"832d67f5-3a73-4d51-9f1c-4b60f5060b53","children":[{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"Date"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 会被序列化为字符串"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"e1ee9b1b-cfa8-453a-8fe5-a9815088d8db","children":[{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0db44513-47ad-4911-9054-9ca672c75479","children":[{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"RegExp"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Promise、Map、Set、WeakMap、WeakSet"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 会被序列化为空对象"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"429062ac-62b4-41d4-b675-6c64b39e86e0","children":[{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ba9b6968-2ede-4f91-bc56-bc59fc963a69","children":[{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"Function"},{"type":"formatted","text":" ，DOM 对象会被忽略"}]}]}]},{"language":"JavaScript","type":"code-block","uuid":"6e6e5e93-e61b-4728-85e5-6c2dc6592ebc","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"62c760d0-73c5-4a04-b91c-bd245c40f608","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const originalObj = {\n    a: 1,\n    b: new Date(),\n    c: new RegExp('\\\\d{2}'),\n    d: function () {\n        return 'hello'\n    },\n    e: Promise.resolve('world'),\n    f: new Map([['a', 1], ['b', 2]]),\n    g: new Set([1, 2, 3]),\n    h: new WeakMap(),\n    i: new WeakSet()\n}\nconst copyObj = JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(originalObj));","collabId":"be6e9fd6-090d-4550-a14c-511b38c7cdad","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_2ce054a3-ba08-44ff-9851-3b8ebad6bfeb.png","type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_2ce054a3-ba08-44ff-9851-3b8ebad6bfeb.png","width":304,"naturalWidth":855,"naturalHeight":740,"tauContract":"9d76